       <p data-template-id="exp2-company" class="canva-text mt-1" style="color: rgb(59, 111, 181); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 14px;">Lehman Hospital, Dehradun • May 2023 – June 2023</p>
      </div>
      <p data-template-id="exp2-desc" class="canva-text mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">Observed clinical workflows across multiple hospital departments and diagnostic equipment operation. Studied healthcare data management practices and applications of AI in clinical decision-making.</p>
     </div>
     <div data-template-id="exp3-card" class="canva-card p-8 rounded-2xl hover-lift" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
      <div>
       <h3 data-template-id="exp3-role" class="canva-text font-bold" style="color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 18px;">Graphic Designer</h3>
       <p data-template-id="exp3-company" class="canva-text mt-1" style="color: rgb(124, 58, 237); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 14px;">Student Association of Biomedical Engineers, Coimbatore • Jul 2023 – Dec 2025</p>
      </div>
      <p data-template-id="exp3-desc" class="canva-text mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">Designed promotional materials for technical seminars and webinars, supporting event outreach and engagement.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </section><!-- Projects -->
  <section data-template-id="projects-section" class="canva-section py-20 px-6" style="background: rgb(240, 253, 250);">
   <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 data-template-id="proj-title" class="canva-text font-heading text-center mb-12" style="color: rgb(13, 59, 59); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Projects</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
     <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover-lift bg-white shadow-lg"><img data-template-id="proj1-img" class="canva-image w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6153082/pexels-photo-6153082.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Close-up of a sleek black prosthetic arm">
      <div class="p-6">
       <h3 data-template-id="proj1-name" class="canva-text font-bold" style="color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Myoelectric Prosthetic Arm</h3>
       <p data-template-id="proj1-desc" class="canva-text mt-2" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 14px;">Built an LSTM-based control model for a myoelectric prosthetic arm, reducing costs by 20% vs commercial alternatives.</p>
       <p data-template-id="proj1-tech" class="canva-text mt-3" style="color: rgb(13, 115, 119); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;">Python • TensorFlow • LSTM • EMG Signal Processing</p>
