     <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover-lift bg-white shadow-lg"><img data-template-id="proj2-img" class="canva-image w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" src="canva://MAEPJURgjBg/1" alt="Stock market data visualization">
      <div class="p-6">
       <h3 data-template-id="proj2-name" class="canva-text font-bold" style="color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Stock Market Data Retrieval</h3>
       <p data-template-id="proj2-desc" class="canva-text mt-2" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 14px;">Developed an automation bot to extract real-time stock market data via API for downstream analysis.</p>
       <p data-template-id="proj2-tech" class="canva-text mt-3" style="color: rgb(13, 115, 119); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;">UiPath • Python • REST APIs</p>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover-lift bg-white shadow-lg"><img data-template-id="proj3-img" class="canva-image w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/4790267/pexels-photo-4790267.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Close-up of a smart speaker with digital time display indoors">
      <div class="p-6">
       <h3 data-template-id="proj3-name" class="canva-text font-bold" style="color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Voice-Assisted Room Automation</h3>
       <p data-template-id="proj3-desc" class="canva-text mt-2" style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 14px;">Built a voice-controlled home automation device to operate appliances for physically disabled users.</p>
       <p data-template-id="proj3-tech" class="canva-text mt-3" style="color: rgb(13, 115, 119); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;">Python • SpeechRecognition • IoT</p>
